Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota's been eating me out of house\Nand home, so shopping's been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a growing boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"100% Courage! Hurricane Star!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yeah, brave and courageous Hurricane Star! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Now go, fight! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Believe in yourself and your friends! Let's go! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's from an anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Was I singing along?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. You're a good singer, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I was singing that\Nin public... I gotta pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with liking anime music?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not into it, but Sota is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He listens to those same CDs over\Nand over, so now I know the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what kind of music {\i1}do {\i0}you like, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know all the words to an anime song!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so you've been having\Nlots of fun with him, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! He comes over\Nall the time to play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You Wear More Than One Face"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! He comes over\Nall the time to play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You Wear More Than One Face"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He even bought me a book, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He even bought me a book, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good going there, Kyoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's he like? Is he cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He reminds me of the\Ndark villain in a detective movie...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of description is that, Kyoko?\NIsn't he your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to talk with him one-on-one sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you wanna discuss with him alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That felt good! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His name's Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Miyamura. First name...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Miyamura's first name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God, he's been coming\Nover to my house for forever now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but I still have no idea what his first name is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And our teacher took\Nthe attendance sheet with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura, you got a first name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! That's the absolute\N{\i1}last {\i0}thing I should do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura, what's P.E. gonna be today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we have a combined class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone call him by his first name! C'mon, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san's watching us change!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,H... Hori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You were peeping? Are you pent up\Nand frustrated or something, Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Class Academic Standings"\N"#1: Kakeru Sengoku"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Class Academic Standings"\N"#1: Kakeru Sengoku"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were a little bit smarter, I'd know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori? You heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru! Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you about Miyamura--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My broken heart's still healing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Some help you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew trying to find out\Nhis name would be this exhausting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyoko, is there\Nsomething wrong with my curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the third day in a row\Nwe've had microwave curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've got no school tomorrow.\NWill Miyamura-kun be coming over?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really? Oh, boy, I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? He's not coming over to hang with {\i1}you{\i0}, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he might tell Mom his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The Next Day"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi! I'm so glad to finally meet you! Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hori's mom! So {\i1}this {\i0}is what she's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I brought you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kyoko's out\Non some errands right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's told me {\i1}so {\i0}much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.95,0:06:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hi, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, Sota's home late.\N--Hi, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, Sota's home late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to sit and chat,\Nbut I have to get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I'll be heading out soon, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?! C'mon, stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for always helping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, she went back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the strawberry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That witch! She sent me on errands\Nso she could talk alone with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom's the first person to call me\Nby my first name since 6th grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt kinda awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She used my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean how she used it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She used -kun. Your mom's pretty young, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this guy literally ever had\Na coherent conversation with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Hori-san, you've been\Nacting kind of weird lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Weird how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you were watching\Nthe guys change at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I had a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you have a crush\Non someone or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My {\i1}name{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you've been so worried about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My name though, really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, sis, you're so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to ask you that, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm borrowing your pen. Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're such a lame-o!\N--I'm borrowing your pen. Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're such a lame-o!\N--I'm a lame-o?! Could a lame-o do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ow, that hurts, you lame-o!\N--I'm a lame-o?! Could a lame-o do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--Here.\N--Ow, that hurts, you lame-o!\N--I'm a lame-o?! Could a lame-o do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Izumi Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, let me write down the pronunciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hand it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--I can read it!\N--Hand it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, I'm keeping this,\Njust in case I forget it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd really rather you didn't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I know, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll remember it easier if you say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it feels weird.\NI'll just keep calling you Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon, Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do {\i1}you {\i0}not know {\i1}my {\i0}first name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's Kyoko, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like a total moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, Hori-san says the dumbest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, start laughing! I know it's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll get mad at me if I laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about all this, Hori-san.\NI know you're already so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally fine! I'd do\Nanything for you, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold onto these for a sec, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Things go much smoother when\Nyou've got capable people on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,On that note, Hori-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,could I ask another favor of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The student council is\Nreally swamped right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's okay. I know how it is, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at your bags!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have bags?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These what the Student Council\Nwanted you to handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to do their work, Hori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of their members are new\Nright now, so they're having a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still weird that they're\Nhaving you do this important stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just using you, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but they need the help, so I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You should!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're too dumb to help out with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,President Sengoku's top of the class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls all like him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Hori-san's helping\Nhim out because she likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ayasaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are the files and notebooks I worked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, they're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got 'em! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's President Sengoku's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hot {\i1}and {\i0}dating each other?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san's on the council, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I don't think she does much work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like their mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! So they're just pushing\Nthe hot girl's work onto you, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, don't put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the work I just did {\i1}was{\i0}\NAyasaki-san's responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're totally making her do her work...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Hori-san's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she'd feel better\Nif I baked her a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--I did, though--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--I don't have time for this! Hurry up and help!\N--I did, though--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--I don't have time for this! Hurry up and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, Sakura's gonna yell\Nat me again for being late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I probably don't need it,\Nso just throw it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even get a word in,\Nand now she's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Budget Report"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I gave you everything I worked on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but there are papers missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--And we can't find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh? What's happening over here?\N--And we can't find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh? What's happening over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun! You gotta help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hori! She's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The student council's yelling at Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you everything yesterday,\Nincluding the budget paperwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw, right, Ayasaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi says she didn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't check to see\Nif it was everything, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but shouldn't you guys--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, some of the blame falls on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But only if those budget papers\Nwere in the pile you handed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, were they in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be honest, I was so tired,\NI can't remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san messed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl in Class 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the council's running behind\Nbecause she lost those papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor Prez...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's your fault, I just want\Nan apology. That's all, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, you asshole--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool it, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Hori finished working\Non the budget! I saw her do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She gave it to you yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, all she has to do is apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, just say sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hold my bag and glasses? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--You don't have to apologize.\N--I'm--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--You don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell them anything, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence is unacceptable!\NWhy did you think you could--?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The budget files! Why do you have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it in the hall yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san told me to throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you to--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhh, you mean in the hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't Hori-san's fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad it got resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was this close to crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're super organized, Hori.\NNo way it could've been you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You really helped me out there, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I just happened to be there is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But why'd you need to headbutt\Nhim if you had the papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was just kinda pissed at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wondering, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the Student Council Prez\Nhave some dirt on you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you always do\Nwhatever he asks you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That {\i1}is {\i0}weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's just 'cause\Nthe student council's so busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sengoku... -kun and I have\Nknown each other for forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, you're such a crybaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Kyo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I {\i1}hate {\i0}peas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When high school starts,\NI'm not going to be your dog anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My {\i1}dog{\i0}? Wow, that's how you saw yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.45,0:18:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're going to use\Nan honorific with my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have a normal,\Nhappy time in high school!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do it, or I'll tell {\i1}everyone{\i0}\Nhow you treated me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What, treated you {\i1}how{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this! This is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku... -kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. Thanks, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I've known him forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He definitely has dirt on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Prez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku was traumatized by what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's almost Hori's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's at the end of March.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's during spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking of getting her something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's turned me down once already.\NI'd just be bothering her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it'd bother her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with\Nwanting to get her something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, but I've got no idea what to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the thought that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get her whatever you want.\NMaybe some jewelry or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that's way too serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a desk ornament?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what kind\Nof stuff she likes, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A present for Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What would I give her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think my bro will\Ncome here every day over break?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, this won't last forever.\NHe'll stop coming someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay... when will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.91,0:20:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When you graduate high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When {\i1}will {\i0}Miyamura stop coming over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be sad if he stopped coming over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be really sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:21:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd be sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, sis, be a little\Nmore honest with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, it's my birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring break made me\Ntotally forget about it. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is from me. Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.16,0:21:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A CD of all the songs people\Nour age are into? The popular ones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The ones I like, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he know that this was what I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.37,0:22:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's my birthday, that means\Nspring break's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.41,0:22:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be third years soon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"That's Why It's Okay"
